#42001
An Unholy Grove~
   As you enter this unholy grove, a thick mist begins to swirl around
you.  The trees grow so densely that they shut out almost all the light
of the outside world, and your light seems barely able to push back the
enclosing darkness, creating only more shadows to play tricks on your
mind.  As you strain to see what lies little more than an arm's length
ahead, you believe you can make out a dark form moving away from you
into the distance, to the north.  The way out of the grove lies south.
~
