#42002
Among the Weeping Trees~
   The darkness closes in even further, and your light casts ever more
bizarre and spectral shadows.  The trees around you look more and more
like trapped souls, frozen in twisted horror and eternal suffering.  The
forest is completely silent: no birdsong, no rustle of small animals in
the undergrowth.  And still, in the distance, the dark figure moves
ahead of you with a swiftness and silence that mocks your best efforts
to follow.  The path continues north and south.
~
