#42003
The Wailing Wind~
   Although the forest is as silent as a tomb, an eerie wind begins to
blow about you here.  It comes from nowhere, gentle yet unnerving, and
though it whistles through the trees it stirs not a single leaf at your
feet.  Then you hear a wailing, a cry straining to reach your ears from
some very far away place.  You tell yourself that it is only the wind.
Ahead of you, still, looms that fleeting dark figure.  Will you ever
catch up to him?  And if you do, do you really wish to learn the secret
of his stealth?  The path leads north and south.
~
