#42005
The Fiend's Clearing~
   The light here, though barely twice as bright as the glow that led
you this far, is almost blinding after the darkness of these woods.  You
can see the twisted horror on the faces of the surrounding trees in
terrible detail.  The wind has stopped as suddenly as it began, and what
was only a superstitious fear is becoming an overwhelming dread.  This
is where the fleeting, noiseless figure was leading you.  To the west a
tall iron gate, topped by a glowing skull, closes off a walled yard,
while to the east the trees open onto a vast, forgotten graveyard.  The
path leads back south.
~
