#42006
The Solitary Crypt~
   Beyond the gate lies a walled-off corner of the graveyard holding
just one crypt.  The sight of a single grave would not unnerve you, but
the demonic figures and strange, ancient glyphs carved into this one
push you to the end of your wits.  Here, too, is the source of the
strange light that has lit your way: no longer dull, but a vibrant
radiance hovering above the crypt, which seems to take shape as you
watch.  A heavy stone door in the crypt leads down, and the gate leads
back east.
~
