#42007
The Forgotten Graveyard~
   You have stumbled upon an immense graveyard, here in the middle of an
endless black forest.  The graves are crumbling from years of neglect,
and the headstones are overgrown with weeds and pale, dead-looking moss.
Perhaps now would be a good time to reflect upon the life you once knew,
and to ponder the pain you may be forced to endure if you continue
through this accursed place.  The graves stretch away to the north and
south, a great black mausoleum looms to the east, and the clearing lies
to the west.
~
