#42011
The Gravedigger's Hut~
   A tumbledown hut of gray planks leans against an old yew tree at the
edge of the graveyard.  Inside are a cot, a cold stove, a rack of
shovels worn down to stubs, and a wall covered from floor to ceiling in
scratched tally marks, one for every grave its owner has ever dug, and a
good many more besides.  The door leads back east into the graveyard.
~
