#42013
The Weeping Angel~
   A great marble statue of a winged woman stands among the graves here,
her face buried in her hands.  Water seeps from between her stone
fingers and runs down her robes to pool at her feet, though there has
been no rain.  Around the statue's base the grass is green, the only
living green in this whole dead place.  Paths lead west and south.
~
