The Mausoleum of House Gemmar~
   A great mausoleum of black marble rises at the heart of the
graveyard, its doors long since broken in.  Within, the floor is lined
with the sealed tombs of a noble house, generation after generation of
them.  At the far end two empty niches stand side by side beneath a
carved inscription.  The mausoleum opens north, south and west.
