#42027
The Sanctum of Morvane~
   This is the heart of the catacombs and the source of the curse upon
the forest above.  A great circle of glyphs has been inlaid in silver in
the floor, and from it run hundreds of black roots, or veins, or both,
climbing the walls and vanishing into the ceiling toward the trees and
the trapped souls within them.  A throne of black stone stands in the
center of the circle.  The only way out is back west.
~
