#42028
The Tomb of Aurelle~
   Behind the white door lies a small, quiet tomb, untouched by the
curse that fills the rest of the catacombs.  The walls are white, the
air is clean, and on a bier in the center of the room lies a young woman
of white marble, her hands folded on her breast, so lifelike that she
might only be sleeping.  A warm golden glow fills the room.  A narrow
opening leads back east to the hall.
~
